1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south, witnessing
the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 22=

34
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:00,440
Weren't you...

35
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,360
You old fox!

36
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,600
How did you know

37
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:08,720
about Yanzhi and me?

38
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,920
I've lived for thousands of years.

39
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,480
Is there anything I don't know?

40
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:15,440
I hate being lied to about love.

41
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,960
You tricked me and tried to run?

42
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,920
(Worry about your woman first.)

43
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,400
Are you okay?

44
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:24,440
Can you tell me

45
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:27,000
what that demon was talking about?

46
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:30,800
What happened between us?

47
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,320
Don't listen to that demon.

48
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,480
Get some rest.

49
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:37,000
I'm going after her.

50
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:48,080
You traitor!

51
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,520
Ancestor!

52
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,640
Ancestor!

53
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:54,880
That snake demon fooled all of you.

54
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:57,000
That monk trapped me in his gourd.

55
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:58,880
I was tortured by heavenly thunder
and earthly fire.

56
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,760
But I never betrayed any of you.

57
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:04,840
Then it seems

58
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:08,080
I misjudged you.

59
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:15,880
Ancestor,

60
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,160
how is my benefactor?

61
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:21,120
Back then,

62
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,480
he gave you his scale.

63
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,960
That's why that rotten monk
hurt him so badly.

64
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:29,040
Now,

65
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:32,200
only the scale you carry

66
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:33,720
can save him.

67
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,240
Take me to him!

68
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:47,280
He is recovering in my cave.

69
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,640
Go save him.

70
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:49,840
I'll lure the monk away.

71
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:50,840
Okay.

72
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,360
Be careful, Ancestor.

73
00:03:54,300 --> 00:04:01,100
(Bless and Protect the People)

74
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,800
Ancestor!

75
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,200
What happened?

76
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:20,000
Su Ling'er betrayed us

77
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:20,920
to become an immortal.

78
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:22,920
She joined forces with that monk

79
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,560
and injured the Ancestor.

80
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,246
You and the Ancestor

81
00:04:27,247 --> 00:04:28,280
both saved her life.

82
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,480
How could she repay you with betrayal?

83
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:32,920
I never knew she could be so heartless.

84
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,320
I'll go demand an explanation.

85
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,760
My Lord,

86
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:39,600
you're injured. Don't move around.

87
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:40,720
You might

88
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,080
disrupt your Qi.

89
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,800
For now,

90
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,240
you need to recover first.

91
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,720
Then we'll find a chance

92
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:51,440
to get the scale back.

93
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:53,480
Until then,

94
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:55,720
we'll protect you while you recover.

95
00:04:59,100 --> 00:05:00,600
Take good care of my wife.

96
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:03,840
Yes,

97
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,080
My Lord.

98
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:30,720
Ancestor,

99
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,080
did that little fox

100
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:33,960
really side with the monk?

101
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:45,280
Su Ling'er is devoted to him.

102
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,240
Why would she

103
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,720
betray him so easily?

104
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:51,720
Three-Headed Jiao is weak-willed.

105
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:53,360
If he knew

106
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,280
taking the scale from Su Ling'er

107
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:56,440
would badly weaken her,

108
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:58,320
he'd never go through with it.

109
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:00,000
That's why

110
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,700
I had you turn him

111
00:06:01,700 --> 00:06:03,120
against Su Ling'er.

112
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,120
Now,

113
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:08,320
he's convinced she betrayed him.

114
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:10,360
Once he recovers,

115
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:13,040
he'll take the scale back himself.

116
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,720
You're quite the strategist, Ancestor.

117
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:16,880
Those two

118
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,440
are no match for you.

119
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,320
Now

120
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,440
is no time to let our guard down.

121
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:26,880
Three-Headed Jiao devoured hearts
filled with greed and infatuation.

122
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:28,280
His power increased dramatically.

123
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,360
Now,

124
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,560
if any demon devours him,

125
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:33,560
they'll gain his spiritual power.

126
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:39,240
I'll stand guard outside the hall

127
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:41,120
in case any demon tries to sneak in.

128
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:44,600
Keep a close eye on Three-Headed Jiao.

129
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,240
Don't worry, Ancestor.

130
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,400
(Ancestor,)

131
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:03,240
(you've lived for thousands of years)

132
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:05,000
(and think you're so clever,)

133
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,360
(but you forgot,)

134
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:08,600
(too many cooks spoil the broth.)

135
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,360
(With such a perfect chance,)

136
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:13,000
(I won't let it go to waste.)

137
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:19,680
Stop!

138
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:41,360
Darling!

139
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,320
You traitor!

140
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:45,480
Let my wife go!

141
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:46,360
Benefactor!

142
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,160
She was trying to kill you!

143
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,360
I'm here to save you.

144
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,160
Darling!

145
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,680
Don't listen to her lies.

146
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:54,360
Save me!

147
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:55,800
Su Ling'er!

148
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,360
You sided with that monk,

149
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,680
got my wife killed,

150
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,880
and injured the Ancestor.

151
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,000
I may be naive,

152
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,120
but I'm not an idiot.

153
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,240
You won't fool me again.

154
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:07,200
When did I ever hurt the Ancestor?

155
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:09,960
Su Ling'er!

156
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,200
You traitor!

157
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,400
Ancestor!

158
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:13,680
Let my wife go!

159
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:14,800
Benefactor,

160
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:15,920
I didn't do it.

161
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,760
You have to believe me.

162
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:18,280
They're...

163
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,560
They're all lying to you!

164
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:24,120
Why would I lie to you, My Lord?

165
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,840
Why turn you against each other?

166
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:27,520
What would I gain?

167
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:28,200
Well...

168
00:08:29,070 --> 00:08:29,323
I...

169
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:31,800
Little fox,

170
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:34,840
he'll never believe you.

171
00:08:35,800 --> 00:08:36,800
Darling!

172
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,560
Save me!

173
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:39,760
Let my wife go!

174
00:08:39,900 --> 00:08:40,280
Or

175
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:41,720
you'll answer to me!

176
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:43,840
Sooner or later,

177
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,680
I'll devour him.

178
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:49,080
Even if you kill me,

179
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:51,000
I won't let her hurt you.

180
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:51,800
Snake demon!

181
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:52,800
Die!

182
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:54,960
Darling!

183
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:57,880
Darling!

184
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,920
I'll kill you!

185
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:06,440
Benefactor!

186
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,080
Darling!

187
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:12,880
Darling!

188
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:15,000
Darling!

189
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:16,720
Darling!

190
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:28,280
My Lord.

191
00:09:28,560 --> 00:09:29,360
Take the scale back!

192
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,920
It may still save your wife.

193
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:36,080
Darling,

194
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:36,800
don't be afraid.

195
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:37,960
I'll use my powers

196
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:38,720
to keep you alive.

197
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:39,640
Darling!

198
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:41,000
Darling!

199
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:42,600
Darling...

200
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,000
I...

201
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,360
I don't want to die.

202
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:48,320
Darling!

203
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:50,320
Darling!

204
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:52,760
Darling!

205
00:09:52,850 --> 00:09:53,320
Darling!

206
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:56,000
Darling!

207
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:58,800
Her body died long ago.

208
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:02,000
- Now even her soul is gone forever.
- Darling!

209
00:10:02,520 --> 00:10:04,680
- No one can bring her back now.
- Darling!

210
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:08,880
No!

211
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:11,960
Darling!

212
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,360
Why would Heaven do this to me?

213
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:19,680
I only wanted to be with my wife.

214
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:21,240
Darling!

215
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:24,280
Why do you keep tearing us apart?

216
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:27,560
You were born under a pure yin fate.

217
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,200
You're destined for misery.

218
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:31,360
Your life can only end in tragedy.

219
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:48,400
I've absorbed Three-Headed Jiao's power.

220
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:50,200
Now I can destroy the Three Realms

221
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:52,000
and avenge a thousand years of hatred.

222
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,200
Oh no!

223
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,760
Arhat Heaven-Turning Seal!

224
00:10:56,760 --> 00:10:57,880
It didn't even faze her!

225
00:10:58,720 --> 00:10:59,960
Nine-Tailed Fox!

226
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:02,080
We're in serious trouble.

227
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,360
I'll go warn Buddha!

228
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,400
Rotten monk!

229
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,720
Even Buddha can't save you now!

230
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:12,520
Monk, even Buddha can't save you!

231
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:26,160
How romantic!

232
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:28,120
Fireworks this late at night!

233
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:29,720
Romantic, my foot!

234
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:31,040
It's obvious

235
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:33,360
some demon is causing trouble.

236
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,720
A demon?

237
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,360
Is that really a demon?

238
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,320
Master!

239
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:42,920
My brother, he...

240
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,000
You had me demoted to a mortal.

241
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,760
Now look who's in trouble.

242
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:53,920
Serves you right!

243
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:58,800
Erlang Shen.

244
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:01,320
Why are you still standing around?

245
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:02,200
The Jade Emperor orders you

246
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:04,400
back to Heaven to protect him.

247
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:05,880
Cut the crap.

248
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:08,120
I'm not going back to be your shield.

249
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:08,480
No way!

250
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,600
Enough!

251
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,560
You're coming with me.

252
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:11,400
Get off me!

253
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:12,880
Stop right there!

254
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:19,280
You old fox!

255
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:22,160
I knew you were plotting something!

256
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:25,360
Blame yourselves for being so stupid.

257
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:27,440
For a thousand years,

258
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:30,320
only immortals and mortals

259
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:32,600
could approach Xuanyuan Tomb.

260
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,280
Three-Headed Jiao

261
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:36,800
actually tore out his own scale

262
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,960
for a fox.

263
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:40,189
Su Ling'er used

264
00:12:40,190 --> 00:12:41,600
the pure yin power in that scale

265
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:42,960
to enter Xuanyuan Tomb.

266
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:45,520
That's when I set my plan in motion.

267
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:47,360
Su Ling'er,

268
00:12:47,800 --> 00:12:49,440
right under your nose,

269
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:50,840
tore out the hearts

270
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:54,120
of the Taoist and Ke Ayao,

271
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:56,800
and you never noticed.

272
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,360
For him,

273
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:02,040
nothing could hurt more

274
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:03,600
than seeing

275
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:07,360
Su Ling'er, the one he trusted most,

276
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:10,800
kill his wife with her own hands.

277
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:15,200
That snake demon thought she was clever,

278
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:18,760
never knowing I'd planned everything.

279
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:22,400
Now that I've devoured Three-Headed Jiao,

280
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:26,520
I have the power to destroy all realms.

281
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:28,520
You're truly ruthless.

282
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:30,680
The irony is,

283
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:34,440
Su Ling'er suffered so much,

284
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:36,160
trying to save Three-Headed Jiao.

285
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:40,080
The love he fought so hard to protect

286
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:42,480
was never mutual.

287
00:13:42,680 --> 00:13:44,880
Yet for the woman who was using him,

288
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:46,600
his own wife,

289
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:50,880
he killed the one who loved him most.

290
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:56,080
What a fool.

291
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:01,400
And you can still laugh?

292
00:14:01,920 --> 00:14:03,320
You've lost every shred of decency.

293
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,200
You don't deserve to be a demon.

294
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:07,000
From this day on,

295
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:09,560
there'll be no more demons,

296
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:11,160
no more immortals.

297
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:13,720
I'll be the one true god.

298
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:20,080
Who can stop me?

299
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,280
You old demon!

300
00:14:26,520 --> 00:14:28,200
Why did you do this to me?

301
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:30,520
You...

302
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,960
You're still alive?

303
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:40,910
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

304
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:44,170
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

305
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:47,970
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

306
00:14:48,020 --> 00:14:51,000
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

307
00:14:51,460 --> 00:14:58,210
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

308
00:14:58,230 --> 00:15:01,760
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

309
00:15:08,470 --> 00:15:11,670
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

310
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:14,930
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

311
00:15:15,220 --> 00:15:18,240
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

312
00:15:18,250 --> 00:15:19,930
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

313
00:15:19,970 --> 00:15:21,850
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

314
00:15:21,890 --> 00:15:23,410
♪I left my wife behind♪

315
00:15:23,550 --> 00:15:25,010
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

316
00:15:25,050 --> 00:15:28,830
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

317
00:15:28,890 --> 00:15:29,970
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

318
00:15:29,980 --> 00:15:32,070
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

319
00:15:32,110 --> 00:15:33,770
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

320
00:15:33,810 --> 00:15:35,640
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

321
00:15:35,670 --> 00:15:39,000
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

322
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:42,270
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

323
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:45,400
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

324
00:15:45,420 --> 00:15:48,770
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

325
00:15:48,820 --> 00:15:52,430
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

326
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:55,780
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

327
00:15:55,820 --> 00:15:58,890
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

328
00:15:59,470 --> 00:16:02,520
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

329
00:16:02,540 --> 00:16:05,960
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

330
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:09,520
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

331
00:16:09,540 --> 00:16:13,000
♪You're just wasting your time♪

332
00:16:13,050 --> 00:16:15,970
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

333
00:16:16,020 --> 00:16:17,630
♪And I just laugh happily♪

334
00:16:17,660 --> 00:16:21,040
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

